flowchart LR
    Q[History query semantics] -->|Walk physical selection| C[Internal read catalog]
    Q -->|Scan physical selection| L[History Scan source acquisition]
    C --> T[Derived tail index and compressed blocks]
    C --> M[Immutable Segment metadata and optional filters]
    T --> I[Verify first group and requested group before offset reads]
    I -->|follow immutable sealed name after rotation| J[Durable journal frames]
    I -->|source reclaimed: Interrupted| B[History bounded retry]
    M -->|describe without file lease| S[Published Segment files]
    L --> J
    L --> S
    C --> V[Published label set consistency check]
    L --> V
    V -->|movement: Interrupted| B[History bounded retry]
    B --> Q
    V -->|source descriptors; metadata handles only| R[Live snapshot validation and exact row selection]
    Q --> R
    R --> A[Answer envelope and page token]
    R --> E[Snapshot evidence]
    E -->|fully covered| M
    E -->|boundary| H[Verify every raw Batch digest]
    S --> H
    H --> F[Borrowed records and typed timestamp reduction]
    F -->|merge only after scan succeeds| A
